<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 126,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 126,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual receipts 126,000 head. Opening trade was not well established.</p>
<p>Early sales of barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower than mid-session Monday. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>				   Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		    50.00 -51.00	   51.00 -52.00</p>
<p>few				49.50 -51.50	   50.50 -52.50</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady/off $2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.	  40.00 -42.00	   41.00 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		   42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		    45.00 -48.50	   46.00 -50.00</p>
